# API Changelog 1.0.0 vs. 1.0.0


## API Changes

### GET /api/test1
-  added the new optional `header` request parameter `x-newrequestheaderparam`


### GET /api/test2
-  added the new optional `query` request parameter `newQueryParam`


### GET /api/test3
-  added the new optional `cookie` request parameter `csrf-token`






